    "body": "## Two reviews of `325187e62` disagree, and the change request stands\n\nReview 1 (06:37:59Z) asks for a change: the Adaptive spiral round a part has no pin, and the scope claim in the goal file and the PR body is true for the dog-bone fixture only.\n\nReview 2 (06:52:43Z) says \"Requested before merge: None\". It does not answer the finding of review 1. It reads the strategy gate and the link proof, and it adds the light lane and the heavy step.\n\nThe rule: a review that asks for a change stays open until the reviewer withdraws the request or a new head gets a clean review. Review 2 does not withdraw it. Thus `needs-rework` stays.\n\nTo close it, add the pin that review 1 asks for:\n1. a fixture where the air plan succeeds with `around_part: true` and Outside,\n2. assert: no fallback note, and the move digest equals `main` before #3818,\n3. use at least Retract and KeepDown,\n4. correct the Adaptive paragraph in `docs/decisions/3822-pocket-ring-scope.md` and in the PR body.\n\nThen the fixed head gets the next review, which includes the light lane.\n",
