    "body": "Rework at 20972341c for the needs-rework finding (review at 325187e62). The finding: no pin covered the Adaptive spiral round a part. New pin: `adaptive_spiral_round_a_part_outside_equals_main_before_3818`. It uses the square fixture of `pocket_hsm_start_tests` with `around_part: true` and Outside. The air plan runs, and there is no fallback. The digest equals `b2ff0ef1b` (main before #3818), and the pin is red with the predicate removed. The PR body and `docs/decisions/3822-pocket-ring-scope.md` now give the correct Adaptive text. The body also names the overlap in `pass_link` with #3824. The branch took a plain merge of origin/main (#3823). Checks: `pass_start_levels` 19 passed, `pocket_pass_start` 5 passed, clippy for motion and app clean. The new head waits for a fresh review.",
